Subject: [PATCH] backports: namespace sk_requests_wifi_status

Linux 6.12.119 already provides sk_requests_wifi_status(), but the
backport is enabled for all kernels older than 6.16. Give the backport
its own name to avoid redefining the kernel helper while retaining
support for older kernels that do not provide it.

--- a/backport-include/net/sock.h
+++ b/backport-include/net/sock.h
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ static inline void backport_sk_error_report(struct sock *sk)
 #endif /* <= 5.14 */
 
 #if LINUX_VERSION_IS_LESS(6,16,0)
+#define sk_requests_wifi_status LINUX_BACKPORT(sk_requests_wifi_status)
 static inline bool
 sk_requests_wifi_status(struct sock *sk)
 {
